<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Sales of 143,700 MT--a marketing-year high--were 70 percent above the prior week and two and one-tenth times the 4-week average.  Israel (75,500 MT) and Japan (43,100 MT) were the major buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 134,200 MT were 6 percent short of prior week's marketing-year high, but were one-fifth above the 4-week average.  The destinations were Japan (77,400 MT), Mexico (52,900 MT), and Nicaragua (3,900 MT) .</p>
</text>
